      "exampleEnglish": "I drink water.",
      "grammarNote": "شرب is fully regular, following the exact same prefix pattern as ذهب: أَشْرَبُ، تَشْرَبُ، تَشْرَبِينَ، يَشْرَبُ، نَشْرَبُ — a good confirmation that most Form I verbs behave this way. أكل's hamza merger last level was the exception, not the rule.",
